{"id": "81f1b033-c4fb-4260-a117-96fd8d45fb3d", "slug": "matrix-harmonization-interface", "title": "Matrix Harmonization Interface", "description": "Matrix Harmonization UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Matrix Harmonization Interface\"\ndescription: \"Matrix Harmonization UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Matrix Harmonization Interface\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 8; favorites: 3; remixes: 1.\nTags: dashboard, charts, bento, animated, navigation, links, social-proof, effect.\n## Overview\nMatrix Harmonization UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nVanguard Structure Resonance Telemetry Authenticate Matrix Initialization Precise vectoring demands constant alignment. Synchronize your telemetry arrays across the entire sector grid. Establish baseline metrics before…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Precise vectoring demands constant alignment..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFFFFF, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #FFFFFF, background #FFFFFF, surface #FFFFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Matrix Harmonization Interface</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-black text-white font-sans overflow-x-hidden antialiased selection:bg-white/30 selection:text-black\">\n\n    <!-- Ambient Grid Background with Vertical Beams -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none flex items-center justify-center opacity-40 z-0\">\n        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-white/10 absolute left-1/4 md:left-1/3 overflow-hidden\">\n            <div class=\"v-beam absolute w-full h-32 left-0\" style=\"top: -10rem; background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), transparent);\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-white/10 absolute right-1/4 md:right-1/3 overflow-hidden\">\n            <div class=\"v-beam absolute w-full h-32 left-0\" style=\"top: -10rem; background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), transparent);\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"h-[1px] w-full bg-white/10 absolute top-1/4 md:top-1/3\"></div>\n        <div class=\"h-[1px] w-full bg-white/10 absolute bottom-1/4 md:bottom-1/3\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Navigation Bar -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed top-0 inset-x-0 w-full flex items-center justify-between px-6 lg:px-12 py-6 z-50 border-b border-white/5 bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-md\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-white font-normal text-sm tracking-wide\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:programming-linear\" width=\"22\" class=\"opacity-80\"></iconify-icon>\n            <span class=\"tracking-widest uppercase text-xs\">Vanguard</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-10 text-xs text-zinc-400 font-light tracking-wide\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Structure</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Resonance</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Telemetry</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n            <button class=\"relative text-xs tracking-wide font-light text-white overflow-hidden rounded-full transition-all hover:bg-white/5\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.2) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 100%); padding: 1px;\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-black flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-2 rounded-full transition-colors hover:bg-zinc-950\">\n                    Authenticate\n                </div>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center pt-40 pb-24 px-6 lg:px-16 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto gap-16\">\n\n        <!-- Top Section: Typography & Controls -->\n        <section class=\"w-full max-w-4xl flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-6 z-20\" id=\"hero-section\">\n            <!-- Decorative Accent -->\n            <div class=\"w-[1px] h-10 mb-2\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Eyebrow (Masked Reveal) -->\n            <div class=\"overflow-hidden mb-2 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.01) 100%); padding: 1px;\">\n                <div class=\"bg-black rounded-full px-4 py-1.5\">\n                    <span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%] text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-zinc-400 uppercase font-light\">\n                        Matrix Initialization\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Masked Staggered Reveal Heading -->\n            <h1 id=\"reveal-text\" class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-light tracking-tight leading-[1.05] text-white flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 mt-2\">\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">Precise</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%] text-zinc-500\">vectoring</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">demands</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">constant</span></span>\n                <span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%] text-zinc-500\">alignment.</span></span>\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"text-zinc-400 max-w-xl text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed font-light mt-4\">\n                Synchronize your telemetry arrays across the entire sector grid. Establish baseline metrics before executing the core sequence to ensure zero-loss data transmission.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Gradient Border Button -->\n            <button class=\"group relative text-sm tracking-wide font-light text-white overflow-hidden rounded-full transition-all hover:bg-white/5 mt-6\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.3) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%); padding: 1px;\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-black flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 rounded-full transition-colors group-hover:bg-zinc-950\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" width=\"18\" class=\"text-zinc-400 group-hover:text-white transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                    Engage Protocol\n                </div>\n            </button>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Middle Section: Hexagon Calibration Dial -->\n        <section class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-center relative mt-4 z-10\">\n            <div class=\"relative w-[340px] h-[340px] md:w-[500px] md:h-[500px] flex items-center justify-center\">\n\n                <!-- Crosshairs extending beyond box -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[150%] h-[1px] bg-white/10\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-[150%] w-[1px] bg-white/10\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Rotating Hexagon Bounding Box (Replacing Square) -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-10 md:inset-14 z-0 w-auto h-auto animate-[spin_60s_linear_infinite_reverse]\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" class=\"w-full h-full text-white/20 overflow-visible\">\n                        <defs>\n                            <linearGradient id=\"hexGradient\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n                                <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.6)\" />\n                                <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\" />\n                            </linearGradient>\n                        </defs>\n                        <!-- Perfect Regular Hexagon Path -->\n                        <polygon points=\"50,0 93.3,25 93.3,75 50,100 6.7,75 6.7,25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#hexGradient)\" stroke-width=\"0.3\"/>\n\n                        <!-- Vertex Handles -->\n                        <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"0\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\"0.9\"/>\n                        <circle cx=\"93.3\" cy=\"25\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\"0.9\"/>\n                        <circle cx=\"93.3\" cy=\"75\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\"0.9\"/>\n                        <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"100\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\"0.9\"/>\n                        <circle cx=\"6.7\" cy=\"75\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\"0.9\"/>\n                        <circle cx=\"6.7\" cy=\"25\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#fff\" opacity=\"0.9\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- The SVG Dial -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-20 pointer-events-none\" id=\"dial-container\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 480 480\" class=\"w-full h-full text-white\">\n                        <defs>\n                            <path id=\"textPathRing\" d=\"M 240, 240 m -140, 0 a 140,140 0 1,1 280,0 a 140,140 0 1,1 -280,0\" />\n                        </defs>\n\n                        <!-- Async Rotating Elements -->\n                        <g id=\"svg-lines\" class=\"opacity-30\" style=\"transform-origin: 240px 240px;\"></g>\n                        <g id=\"svg-degrees\" class=\"opacity-70\" style=\"transform-origin: 240px 240px;\"></g>\n\n                        <!-- Looping Rotating Text Group -->\n                        <g id=\"rotating-text-group\" style=\"transform-origin: 240px 240px;\">\n                            <text fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"300\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.15em; filter: blur(4px); opacity: 0.6;\">\n                                <textPath href=\"#textPathRing\" startOffset=\"0%\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n                                    HARMONIC VECTORING\n                                </textPath>\n                            </text>\n                            <text fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"300\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.15em;\">\n                                <textPath href=\"#textPathRing\" startOffset=\"50%\" text-anchor=\"middle\">\n                                    CALIBRATE MATRIX\n                                </textPath>\n                            </text>\n                        </g>\n\n                        <!-- Center Logo/Icon -->\n                        <g transform=\"translate(240, 240) scale(1.4)\" class=\"opacity-20\">\n                            <!-- Hexagonal Core to fit the new aesthetic -->\n                            <polygon points=\"0,-15 13,-7.5 13,7.5 0,15 -13,7.5 -13,-7.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" transform=\"rotate(30)\" />\n                            <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" />\n                        </g>\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Bottom Section: Social Proof -->\n        <section class=\"w-full flex flex-col items-center gap-8 mt-12 z-20\">\n            <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-600 tracking-widest font-light uppercase\">Bridging sub-routines for</span>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-10 md:gap-20 opacity-60\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-300\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-linear\" width=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-sm tracking-tight font-normal\">Sentient</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-300\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:atom-linear\" width=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-sm tracking-tight font-normal\">Nova</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-300\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-star-linear\" width=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-sm tracking-tight font-normal\">Apex</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-300\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:radar-2-linear\" width=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-sm tracking-tight font-normal\">Horizon</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- 1. Generate SVG Dial Ticks & Degrees ---\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            const linesContainer = document.getElementById('svg-lines');\n            const degreesContainer = document.getElementById('svg-degrees');\n            const cx = 240;\n            const cy = 240;\n            const radiusInner = 190;\n            const radiusOuter = 200;\n            const textRadius = 220;\n\n            let linesContent = '';\n            let degreesContent = '';\n\n            for (let angle = 0; angle < 360; angle += 5) {\n                const rad = (angle - 90) * (Math.PI / 180);\n                const isMajor = angle % 15 === 0;\n                const rInner = isMajor ? radiusInner - 5 : radiusInner;\n\n                const x1 = cx + rInner * Math.cos(rad);\n                const y1 = cy + rInner * Math.sin(rad);\n                const x2 = cx + radiusOuter * Math.cos(rad);\n                const y2 = cy + radiusOuter * Math.sin(rad);\n\n                // Populate Lines (Ticks)\n                linesContent += `<line x1=\"${x1}\" y1=\"${y1}\" x2=\"${x2}\" y2=\"${y2}\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"${isMajor ? 1.5 : 0.5}\" />`;\n\n                // Populate Degrees Async (Text)\n                if (isMajor) {\n                    const tx = cx + textRadius * Math.cos(rad);\n                    const ty = cy + textRadius * Math.sin(rad);\n\n                    degreesContent += `\n                        <g transform=\"translate(${tx}, ${ty}) rotate(${angle})\">\n                            <text x=\"0\" y=\"0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\" class=\"font-mono tracking-wider\">${angle}°</text>\n                        </g>\n                    `;\n                }\n            }\n\n            linesContainer.innerHTML = linesContent;\n            degreesContainer.innerHTML = degreesContent;\n        });\n\n        // --- 2. GSAP Animations ---\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        // Vertical Grid Beam Animation\n        gsap.fromTo(\".v-beam\",\n            { top: \"-10rem\" },\n            { top: \"100%\", duration: 5, ease: \"none\", repeat: -1, stagger: 2.5 }\n        );\n\n        // Text continuous rotation\n        gsap.to(\"#rotating-text-group\", {\n            rotation: -360,\n            duration: 40,\n            repeat: -1,\n            ease: \"none\",\n            svgOrigin: \"240 240\"\n        });\n\n        // Lines (ticks) continuous rotation\n        gsap.to(\"#svg-lines\", {\n            rotation: 360,\n            duration: 75,\n            repeat: -1,\n            ease: \"none\",\n            svgOrigin: \"240 240\"\n        });\n\n        // Degrees (angles) ASYNC continuous rotation\n        gsap.to(\"#svg-degrees\", {\n            rotation: -360, // Opposite direction to lines\n            duration: 90,   // Different speed to lines\n            repeat: -1,\n            ease: \"none\",\n            svgOrigin: \"240 240\"\n        });\n\n        // Masked Word Reveal\n        const revealWords = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-word');\n        if (revealWords.length > 0) {\n            gsap.to(revealWords, {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \"#hero-section\",\n                    start: \"top 85%\",\n                    toggleActions: \"play none none reverse\"\n                }\n            });\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "matrix-harmonization-interface.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/matrix-harmonization-interface.jpg", "source_name": "matrix-harmonization-interface-DESIGN.md", "views": 91, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T07:35:56.964138+00:00"}